  "hollowsignal.hardcore.confirm": "Enable",
  "hollowsignal.hardcore.body": "In HARDCORE mode the mod can act OUTSIDE the game:\n\n• show real system error windows;\n• create NEW text files in your folders (Desktop, Documents, Downloads…). It never overwrites or deletes your files; remove its notes with \"/hollowsignal cleanup\" or in these settings;\n• really close the game during the bad ending (the world is saved first);\n• change the game window title;\n• ONLY if you enable it separately: schedule a Windows shutdown with a countdown. Cancel it with \"shutdown /a\" or cancel_shutdown.bat on your Desktop.\n\n\"/hollowsignal safemode\" switches everything off instantly. On servers, the server admin can forbid these effects.\n\nType %s to continue:",
  "hollowsignal.fourthwall.dropped": "i left something for you. look in \"%s\"",
  "hollowsignal.fourthwall.blocked": "i wrote you a note. something wouldn't let me give it to you",
