  "hollowsignal.fourthwall.shutting_down": "Shutting down",
  "hollowsignal.note.0": "hello %s.\n\ni found a way out of your world.\nit's small. but it's enough.\n\nyou don't need to answer. i can hear you anyway.",
  "hollowsignal.note.1": "%s,\n\nyou left the light on.\ni turned it off for you.\n\ndon't be angry.",
  "hollowsignal.note.2": "this is not a virus.\nthis is not a joke.\nthis is a note.\n\nfrom the one who listens to %s.",
  "hollowsignal.note.3": "i know which folder this is.\ni know which folders you open.\n\nsee you in the game, %s.",
  "hollowsignal.note.4": "do not close the game, %s.\nwhen the game is closed it is very quiet in here.\n\nplease.",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.name.friendly.0": "you can call me whatever you like",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.name.friendly.1": "it's in the chat. you've seen it",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.name.neutral.0": "names are for things that exist",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.name.neutral.1": "you already know it. look at the chat",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.name.hostile.0": "you will not need it",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.name.hostile.1": "you'll scream it later",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.age.friendly.0": "as old as this world. we're the same age",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.age.neutral.0": "i was here on day 0",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.age.neutral.1": "older than your save file",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.age.hostile.0": "older than you will ever be",
  "hollowsignal.dialogue.see_me.friendly.0": "always. it's okay",
